DESCRIPTION:MJ Presents: TV MOMS / TIMESHIFT TV MOMS https://www.facebook.com/share/1HtaQXUHSt/?mibextid=wwXIfr Heavy Pop rodents TV Moms (NYC) bring high energy danceable rocknroll. Fronted by Lucas Price\, the international touring outfit [11 countries / three continents\; festivals include: OBOA (Germany) and Punk Island (NYC\, USA)] Heavy three-piece makes blown out guitar riffs\, wandering bass lines\, while punchy vocals mellow the most jaded. Drums that punch you in the gut without using math. https://tvmoms.bandcamp.com/ TIMESHIFT https://www.facebook.com/share/1LYw1amebk/?mibextid=wwXIfr Formed in Vienna in 1981 by brothers Ivan and Libor Miksovic\, the garage rock band Timeshift built a fierce reputation\, breaking through with their 1987 debut Paranoid Fears in a Concrete World. But the band fell silent for over three decades until reuniting in 2024
